检查全域设备的在线状态、漏洞和基线核查，按设备汇总问题并生成报告。\",\"definitionVersion\":\"V5\",\"matchPhrases\":[\"帮我做一次巡检\",\"执行一次常规巡检\",\"做一次巡检\",\"设备综合巡检\"],\"defaultForChat\":true,\"inspectionItems\":[\"设备在线状态\",\"设备漏洞\",\"基线核查\"],\"runtimeInputSchema\":{}},{\"templateId\":\"template-3183f77512a749c8b649fa6aad7a8783\",\"taskId\":\"task-c8a8abebe54e43548a09ecb21eb58f60\",\"name\":\"漏洞专项巡检\",\"description\":\"检查当前资产清单中的设备漏洞，按设备展示漏洞及风险建议；不包含设备在线状态和基线。\",\"definitionVersion\":\"V1\",\"matchPhrases\":[],\"defaultForChat\":false,\"inspectionItems\":[\"设备漏洞\"],\"runtimeInputSchema\":{}}]"}],"isError":false,"id":"135fdfbe-60d5-4594-bed8-daa161b04aeb"}},"sourceEventSeqs":[24],"surfaceOp":"append"}}
